# Attributes and actions

**Status:** current.

| Form | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `class="card"` | Static string |
| `class={expr}` | Roc expression |
| `disabled` | Boolean attribute |
| `data-on:click=@post("/actions/x")` | Datastar backend action |

Hyphenated names are legal (`aria-current`, `data-on:click`). Prop spreading
and dynamic attribute names are **not** supported.

On HTML, attributes become `Html.attribute` / `Html.boolean_attribute`. On
component tags they become a props record.

## Datastar actions

`@get`, `@post`, `@put`, `@patch`, `@delete` in attribute position take Roc
arguments (`"/path"`, not `'/path'`). Using an action injects `import Datastar`
when missing. A second argument is a `List` of option tags and lowers to
`*_with`. Quoted `"@post('…')"` is opaque Datastar JS, not a Rocci action.

**Errors:** `@post('/x')` with single quotes is a parse error.

**Related:** [Server declarations](/docs/reference/language/server/), [Runtime](/docs/reference/runtime/).
